+    returned None ("length only") whenever the layout could not be mapped, and a
+    fabricated slice was exactly the case that could not be mapped - i.e. the
+    fallback was the bypass.  The softening that remains is only for artifacts
+    whose text cannot be anchored anywhere: when the source body cannot be read
+    at all the entry is reported as ``no_source`` by the caller.
+    """
+    if not bodies:
+        return None  # legacy: the caller reports substring_only / no_source
